# Tolsimir, Midnight's Light: "Whenever a Wolf you control attacks, if Tolsimir attacked this combat" needs both halves. On turn 3 Voja
# Fenstalker attacks alone (Tolsimir stays home): the condition fails as it triggers (CR 603.4), nothing goes on the stack, and Bot2's Young
# Wolf is free not to block. On turn 4 Bot2's own Young Wolf attacks while Bot1 controls Tolsimir: it is no Wolf Bot1 controls, so nothing
# triggers. On turn 5 Tolsimir attacks alone: he is no Wolf, so nothing triggers either, and Bot2's Young Wolf, tapped from attacking, could not block him anyway.

